# Files that control releases, licensing and trust. The "baseline" ruleset
# requires a code owner's approval for any pull request that changes them, so
# even brindle-bot's own PRs need a person here. Everything else has no code
# owner and merges on green CI.
/.github/                @hmlerner
/pyproject.toml          @hmlerner
/uv.lock                 @hmlerner
/LICENSE                 @hmlerner
/SCHEDULE-A              @hmlerner
/CLA.md                  @hmlerner
/src/brindle/pro/        @hmlerner
# The desktop app's signed builds: the updater key, endpoints and CSP, its
# permissions, the engine build, notarization and publish gate, and the
# locked dependencies every signed build ships.
/app/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json  @hmlerner
/app/src-tauri/capabilities/    @hmlerner
/app/scripts/                   @hmlerner
/app/package-lock.json          @hmlerner
/app/src-tauri/Cargo.lock       @hmlerner
# The test-suite gates: raising the test budget, grandfathering a finding or
# changing who can waive the new-test check is a decision for a person.
/scripts/check_test_quality.py      @hmlerner
/scripts/check_new_tests.py         @hmlerner
/scripts/test_quality_baseline.json @hmlerner
